  Description: "Face Mesh examples for Specs: AI-generated character heads (Capybara, Egg Guy, Frog, Pirate Shark) worn over the face of the person you look at, driven live by their expressions through the tracked Face Mesh. Cycle heads from a UIKit panel or by waving, scale and fade them, and toggle a debug view of the raw Face Mesh. Instantiate FaceMeshExamples__PLACE_IN_SCENE to try it."
